   "text": "\"Come back!\" cried the little old woman. \"Come back!\" cried the little old man. Then the little old woman and the little old man ran after the gingerbread man. The gingerbread man ran and ran. He laughed and said, \"Run, run, as fast as you can! You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man!\"",
